# Assay, key names only. Real values go in the app's Settings view,
# which writes <install>/data/config.json. Nothing secret belongs here.
#
# Env vars are read as a FALLBACK when the config file has no value, so you can
# also export these in your shell if you prefer.

# Business discovery. Needs "Places API (New)" enabled and billing on.
# This is the only key the current build actually reads.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# NOT WIRED UP. Listed so the names are documented, not because setting them
# does anything today. The Settings view refuses to store all three, and the
# main process refuses them too.
#
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY   the Agent SDK path is not built, and 'auto' mode always
#                       runs the claude CLI. Run `claude login` instead.
#   LOB_API_KEY         no sender exists in this build.
#   POSTGRID_API_KEY    no sender exists in this build.
#
# Uncomment and add the name to WIRED_KEY_NAMES in src/main/ipc/handlers.ts
# when the code that consumes it lands.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# LOB_API_KEY=
# POSTGRID_API_KEY=
